/* ---------- Micro scale: the place where the drilled hole crosses the crack ----------
   A sectioned sample of hardened cement paste, seen from above at an angle. The section runs through the axis of the drilled hole, so the hole
   shows as a half pipe and the crack as a canyon. Everything is generated: relief, crystals, dust, tools, resins. Schematic, not to scale.
   Stages: leak, drill, clean, packer, p1 (AQUAFIN-P1, where water flows), p4 (AQUAFIN-P4), sealed. Without a hole (adhesive packers): leak, p4, sealed. */
