'AQUAFIN-IC overcoat, 1st coat', brushIC3: '2nd coat while the first is still tacky', trowelIM: 'ASOCRET-IM filled flush with the trowel, wet in wet', coveT: 'Cove formed with the trowel, approx. 4 cm, rounded',
