  'wp.kicker': 'Waterproofing and Restoration · Waterproofing materials – mineral-based', 'wp.title': 'Mineral-based waterproofing', 'wp.sub': 'Cementitious slurries and flexible thick-layer coatings, applied as one system.',
  'wp.intro': 'The rigid slurries {AQ1K} and {AQ1KP} for substrates that are not prone to cracking, the crack-bridging slurry {AQ2K}, the rapid flexible coating {RB400} for pressing water and radon, and the OS 5b surface protection {OS} for car park decks. Mineral, watertight, vapour permeable — applied by brush, trowel or spray.',
  'wp.btn1': 'Build up the system', 'wp.btn2': 'Calculate the material', 'wp.btn3': 'Products on schomburg.com', 'wp.photoCap': 'System build-up: substrate levelled, sealing cove installed, two coats of waterproofing, detail sealed, protected.',
  'wp.stats': [['crack bridging', '> 2', 'mm', '{RB400} after PG MDS/FPD: 2 mm; ASTM C836 > 3 mm'], ['watertight up to', '5.0', 'bar', '{RB400} at 3.0 mm dry film thickness; {AQ2K} 2.5 bar; {AQ1K} 1 bar'], ['negative side', '0.75', 'bar', 'all slurries against pressing water from the rear, WTA datasheet 4-6'], ['overcoat after', '90', 'min', '{AQ1KP}: recoatable after approx. 90 minutes — even under unfavourable conditions']],
