  'wp.adv.label': 'Advantages', 'wp.adv.title': 'Why the system works',
  'wp.adv.cards': [['Crack bridging, PG MDS/FPD', 'to 2 mm', 'Flexible where it has to be', '{RB400} bridges cracks of up to 2 mm (ASTM C836 > 3 mm), {AQ2K} up to 0.4 mm — both even at −5 °C (DIN EN 14891 > 0.75 mm). {OS}: class A4 (2.0 mm) static, B2 dynamic at −20 °C.'], ['Watertightness', 'to 5.0 bar', 'Against pressing water', '{RB400} at 3.0 mm dry film (PG MDS/FPD); {AQ2K} to 2.5 bar; {AQ1K} and {AQ1KP} to 1 bar. All to 0.75 bar from the negative side (WTA 4-6).'], ['Dry film thickness', '2.0–4.0 mm', 'From the water impact class', '{RB400}: ≥ 2.0 mm on concrete (W1.1-E, W1.2-E, W4-E), ≥ 3.0 mm on masonry, ≥ 4.0 mm for pressing water W2.1-E. {AQ2K}: > 2.0 mm, standing seepage water > 3.0 mm.'], ['Second coat after', '3 h', 'Rapid reactive drying', '{RB400}: rainproof after approx. 3 hours, sealing against 1 bar pressing water after approx. 16 hours, withstands pressurised water after ≥ 1 day. {AQ1KP}: overcoat after approx. 90 minutes.'], ['Adhesion', '≥ 0.5 N/mm²', 'On matt damp substrates', 'Tensile adhesion strength DIN EN 1542 ≥ 0.5 N/mm² ({OS}: ≥ 0.8 N/mm²). The slurries adhere to matt damp substrates without primers; very absorbent substrates are primed with {PRIM}.'], ['Pot life', 'approx. 60 min', 'Time to work', '{AQ1K} and {AQ2K} approx. 60 minutes, {RB400} approx. 45, {AQ1KP} and {OS} approx. 30 minutes, at 5–30 °C. Brush, trowel (coating-thickness or notched trowel) and spray.']],
