/* ===== Retrospective concrete waterproofing (crystalline): content =====
   Source of every product statement: SCHOMBURG technical data sheets AQUAFIN-IC (08/07/2026), ASOCRET-IM (01/06/2026), FIX-20-T (20/05/2026),
   the product pages and the system page "Retrospective concrete waterproofing" on schomburg.com (eight application steps). The guide is
   about the SYSTEM: the leak stopped with the rapid mortar, cracks and coves made good with the crystalline repair mortar, the crystalline
   slurry in two coats brushed into the matt damp concrete, kept damp so that the crystals grow — from the inside, against pressing water. */
