    'rc.adv.label': 'Advantages', 'rc.adv.title': 'Why the system works',
    'rc.adv.cards': [['Crystal growth', 'permanently active', 'The water becomes the transport medium', 'The active ingredients of {IC} penetrate the concrete through its capillaries; water entering the component carries them deeper. They react to insoluble crystals that fill the smallest pores and cracks — and go on doing so whenever water arrives.'], ['Negative side', '1.5 bar', 'From the inside, against pressing water', '{IC} is watertight against negative pressing water up to 1.5 bar; {IM} is suitable for negative water pressure. Basements, pits and tanks are sealed from the accessible side, without excavation.'], ['Positive side', '14 bar', 'Impermeability to water', 'CRD-C 48-92: 14 bar. Under EN 1504-2 (principle 2.2, moisture control) the capillary water absorption is w < 0.1 kg/m²·h⁰·⁵ while the coating stays vapour permeable (class I, sD < 5 m).'], ['Self-healing', 'cracks ≤ 0.4 mm', 'Cracks that develop later', 'Hairline cracks that open after the application are sealed by renewed crystal growth ({IC} increased active crack healing). Static cracks and joints wider than 0.4 mm are opened 20 × 25 mm and filled with {IM}.'], ['Drinking water', 'W 270 / W 347', 'Tested to the DVGW worksheets', '{IC} is suitable for drinking water containers; the tank is rinsed thoroughly with drinking water before it is filled. Filling of containers is possible after 3 days.'], ['Leak stopped', 'approx. 2 min pot life', 'The rapid mortar', '{F20} solidifies after 1–2 minutes, even under water, with a strong bond to concrete and no corrosion-promoting substances: approx. 3 N/mm² after 1 hour, approx. 30 N/mm² after 28 days.']],
    'rc.pictos': [['1K', 'Three one-component mortars', '{IC}, {IM} and {F20}: pre-blended dry mortars, mixed with water on site'], ['check', 'Tested', 'DIN EN 1504-2 with Declaration of Performance, CRD-C 48-92, DVGW worksheets W 270 and W 347, reaction to fire A1'], ['drop', 'Watertight and vapour permeable', 'chloride-free, carbonation reducing, can be applied to damp substrates']],
    'rc.adv.lists': [['Areas of application:', ['waterproofing concrete containers: water tanks, sludge tanks and septic tanks — {IC}', 'reliable waterproofing of concrete substrates from the inside, against negative pressing water up to 1.5 bar', 'watertight filling of open cracks and holes, coving mortar — {IM}', 'sealing water-bearing holes, cracks and fissures in concrete, masonry and natural stone — {F20}', 'repair of concrete surfaces prior to the surface waterproofing; fastening wall anchors for short-term loads — {F20}']], ['Product features:', ['crystalline waterproofing slurry with increased active crack healing — {IC}', 'capillary active repair mortar, supports the self-repair of the concrete — {IM}', 'swellable rapid mortar with crystalline sealing effect, high early and ultimate strength — {F20}', 'all three chloride-free; {F20} free of corrosion-promoting substances', 'suitable substrate: concrete ({IC}, {IM}); also masonry and natural stone ({F20})']], ['Advantages:', ['can be applied to damp substrates; the concrete is worked matt damp', 'penetrates the concrete via the capillaries and remains permanently active', 'watertight, vapour permeable, carbonation reducing', 'withstands high hydrostatic loading; suitable for drinking water', 'rapid solidification of the plugging mortar, even under water']]],
