    'ca.btn1': 'See the system', 'ca.btn2': 'Calculate the dosage', 'ca.btn3': 'Products on schomburg.com', 'ca.photoCap': 'The effect in the section of a wall under water pressure: the denser matrix moves the capillary zone outwards, so water, chlorides and carbon dioxide stay away from the reinforcement. Switch between the reference concrete and the concrete with BETOCRETE.',
