    'ca.calc.note': 'Guide values from the technical data sheets. Liquid: 1.75–2.25 % of the cement weight ({CL170}, {CL210}): 1.75 % at w/c < 0.4, 1.85 % at > 0.4–0.5, 2.00 % at > 0.5–0.55; with ≥ 400 kg/m³ of cement 7.00 kg/m³ is sufficient. Powder: 0.75–1.25 % ({CP360}, {CP350}): 0.75 / 0.80 / 0.90 % ({CP360}) or 0.75 / 0.80 / 0.95 % ({CP350}); with ≥ 400 kg/m³ of cement 3.50 kg/m³ is sufficient. The dosage depends on the cement content and the w/c ratio of the recipe; the table is a guide — preliminary tests are always necessary. Unless otherwise agreed, the manufacturer is responsible for the concrete mix design.',
